get.description:
Only available for users with the manager role.
This endpoint return an array of statistics based on agents. Each statistics object has the following schema:
```
{
  "agent_id": 2,
  "agent": "Agent 2",
  "criterion_json": [
   "Criterion 1": {
     "name": "Criterion 1",
     "total_grade": 5,
     "total_count": 1,
   },
   "Criterion 2": {
     "name": "Criterion 2",
     "total_grade": 5,
     "total_count": 1,
   },
  ],
 "total_feedbacks": 1,
}
```

